      "content": "This feeling that seeking help is more work feels incredibly isolating, and it is okay to feel that way when the pain itself is so exhausting. You do not need to \"perform\" or explain your life to receive support, so if a professional feels like a burden, give yourself the space to rest or seek help through methods that feel less burdensome to you. While the world may currently feel like it is in a constant cycle, your feeling of \"being done\" is a valid state to honor, and you are worthy of care even on the days you have nothing left to give.",
